// ============================ CRYPT 幽影地穴 — ground decals + standing decor ============================
// Low-contrast floor decals (cracks / seams / grime / debris) that read as texture, not props —
// never outlined, values kept within ~10-18% of the crypt floor tone ('#24262f') so they don't
// compete with pickups or enemies. Two decals (rune, stain) carry a faint translucent overlay,
// never a bright point-glow. Standing decor follows the existing bd_crypt_* convention:
// softShadow -> body -> rimLight(cool) -> outline(P.ink).

// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// (a) ground decals — anchor 'center' (array anchors are PIXEL coords in sprites.js), flat, no outline
// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

